Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:53:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(memory): add cross-Session long-term memory

A size-capped MEMORY.md the agent curates, FTS5 episodic recall over past
Sessions (node:sqlite), and a post-turn reflect pass on the agent's own
route. Media transcripts from read_audio/read_video are stored unclipped so
recall can answer questions about earlier recordings.

